 "session_ne": "दोस्रो",
 "summary": "The name of this Act is \"Act Relating to Revival of Previous Provisions of the Nepal Special Service Act, 2042, 2083\" (Section 1, Subsection 1). The main purpose of this Act is to revive the previous provisions that were in force prior to the amendment of the Nepal Special Service Act, 2042 by the Nepal Special Service (Second Amendment) Ordinance, 2082 (Preamble). Where the Nepal Special Service (Second Amendment) Ordinance, 2082 amended the Nepal Special Service Act, 2042, the provisions of the said Act existing before such amendment shall be deemed to have been revived from the date on which the said Ordinance became inactive (Section 2). This Act shall come into force immediately (Section 1, Subsection 2).",
